flowchart TB
    accTitle: Council implementation modules
    accDescr: Model tools and bound SDK or extension events enter the Council domain. Canonical contracts validate data, SQLite persists messages and replies, and the existing gateway runtime and model loop deliver them. There is no separate agent scheduler.
    Host["Model tools<br/>council/host"] --> Core["Council policy<br/>council/core"]
    SDK["Bound SDK / extension<br/>publish and self-wake"] --> Core
    Contracts["Portable contracts<br/>vis-contract/council"] -. validation .-> Core
    Core <-->|entries, pings, replies| Store[("SQLite<br/>log and improve")]
    Core -->|eligible wake| Runtime["Gateway runtime<br/>state"]
    Runtime -->|ordinary turn| Loop["Model loop<br/>input and final-answer gate"]
    Core -->|attributed input| Loop
    Loop -->|tool execution| Host
